        "Composite Structures Laboratory",
        "Inquiry"
      ],
      "text": "Composite Structures Laboratory Opened in 1994, the Composite Structures Laboratory has a 9 m (30 ft) high by 5.5 m (18 ft) wide reaction wall which is 0.61 m (2 ft) thick. The total floor area is 14.3 (47 ft) long by 7.2 m (23.5 ft) wide. The usable floor space in front of the reaction wall is 12.2 m (40 ft) long by 6.4 m (21 ft) wide. The strong floor is a 0.61 m (2 ft) thick reinforced concrete slab. Inquiry Professor Mehran Tehrani Email: tehrani@ucsd.edu Professor Hyonny Kim Email: hyonny@ucsd.edu",
